	(text "SHARED-PIN NOTES:\n• GPIO14/15: Shared between GPS UART and IR subsystem. Software selects one at a time.\n• GPIO17: Shared between Rotary Encoder CLK and Haptic Motor. Muxed in software.\n• GPIO21: Shared between iButton 1-Wire and Logic Analyzer CH2. Muxed in software.\n• GPIO9/10/11: Shared between SPI bus and RGB LED. LED driven during SPI idle."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215 220 0)
		(effects
